{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf031:l001", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 31, "folio": 414, "line_in_page": 1, "raw": "Элге тенти салганың,", "text": "Элге тенти салганың,", "en": "You sent wanderers among the people,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The second word is a provisional reading of joined cursive; the sense may concern sending word through the people.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf031:l002", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 31, "folio": 414, "line_in_page": 2, "raw": "Элден кабар алганың,", "text": "Элден кабар алганың,", "en": "You gathered news from the people,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf031:l003", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 31, "folio": 414, "line_in_page": 3, "raw": "Мында туруп Ысык-Текур,", "text": "Мында туруп Ысык-Текур,", "en": "Here stood Ysyk-Tekur,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The final two words appear to be a proper name or title, provisionally read Ысык-Текур.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf031:l004", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 31, "folio": 414, "line_in_page": 4, "raw": "Көк жалдыгы көк белем,", "text": "Көк жалдыгы көк белем,", "en": "Was he the blue-maned gray,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The manuscript seems to read көк жалдыгы көк белем; the idiomatic force and punctuation are uncertain.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf031:l005", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 31, "folio": 414, "line_in_page": 5, "raw": "Колой оор бир сөзү,", "text": "Колой оор бир сөзү,", "en": "One grave word from Koloy,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The first name is provisionally normalized as Колой; the line is syntactically continued.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf031:l006", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 31, "folio": 414, "line_in_page": 6, "raw": "Чоң кайратка бүткөндөй,", "text": "Чоң кайратка бүткөндөй,", "en": "As though endowed with great courage,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf031:l007", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 31, "folio": 414, "line_in_page": 7, "raw": "Чоңдун кылыч кыйган жүрбү,", "text": "Чоңдун кылыч кыйган жүрбү,", "en": "Did the great one go striking with his sword,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The middle phrase is difficult cursive; кылыч кыйган is the best visual reading.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf031:l008", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 31, "folio": 414, "line_in_page": 8, "raw": "Кайран менен жүргөндөй.", "text": "Кайран менен жүргөндөй.", "en": "As though he went with the valiant one.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Кайран is clear, but its referent and the instrumental construction are context-dependent.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf031:l009", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 31, "folio": 414, "line_in_page": 9, "raw": "Үчүнчү мында турганда,", "text": "Үчүнчү мында турганда,", "en": "When the third stood here,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf031:l010", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 31, "folio": 414, "line_in_page": 10, "raw": "Кыска сөздү уласам,", "text": "Кыска сөздү уласам,", "en": "To continue the tale briefly,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf031:l011", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 31, "folio": 414, "line_in_page": 11, "raw": "Кытай аркы Какандын,", "text": "Кытай аркы Какандын,", "en": "Of the Chinese, of distant Kakan,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The middle word is provisionally read аркы.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf031:l012", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 31, "folio": 414, "line_in_page": 12, "raw": "Калың элин жыйнаган,", "text": "Калың элин жыйнаган,", "en": "He gathered its teeming people,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf031:l013", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 31, "folio": 414, "line_in_page": 13, "raw": "Суурманын турганда,", "text": "Суурманын турганда,", "en": "When Suurman stood there,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The apparent proper name Суурманын may instead be an inflected common noun or another name.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf031:l014", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 31, "folio": 414, "line_in_page": 14, "raw": "Кай кайтарлар неме жок,", "text": "Кай кайтарлар неме жок,", "en": "There was no one to turn them back,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The phrase кай кайтарлар is a best-effort reading of compressed cursive.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf031:l015", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 31, "folio": 414, "line_in_page": 15, "raw": "Казынасы бузуу жок,", "text": "Казынасы бузуу жок,", "en": "His treasury remained unbroken,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The final phrase looks like бузуу жок; English gives its likely contextual sense.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf031:l016", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 31, "folio": 414, "line_in_page": 16, "raw": "Эсеп алган кезинде,", "text": "Эсеп алган кезинде,", "en": "When he took the reckoning,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf031:l017", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 31, "folio": 414, "line_in_page": 17, "raw": "Какандан башка калаа жок,", "text": "Какандан башка калаа жок,", "en": "There was no city besides Kakan,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf031:l018", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 31, "folio": 414, "line_in_page": 18, "raw": "Калың кытай калганда,", "text": "Калың кытай калганда,", "en": "When the teeming Chinese remained,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf031:l019", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 31, "folio": 414, "line_in_page": 19, "raw": "Үчүнчүгө Дыйшага,", "text": "Үчүнчүгө Дыйшага,", "en": "Third, to Dyisha,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The case endings and the proper name Дыйша are clear enough visually, but the compressed syntax depends on the next lines.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf031:l020", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 31, "folio": 414, "line_in_page": 20, "raw": "Баласы шаардын бакырчун,", "text": "Баласы шаардын бакырчун,", "en": "His son, the city’s herald,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The final word is provisionally read бакырчун and interpreted as one who cries out or proclaims.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf031:l021", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 31, "folio": 414, "line_in_page": 21, "raw": "Хандын түндү калганы,", "text": "Хандын түндү калганы,", "en": "The khan’s night had fallen,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The line appears to read түндү калганы, but its precise idiomatic sense is uncertain.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf031:l022", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 31, "folio": 414, "line_in_page": 22, "raw": "Каш кайтарлар неме жок,", "text": "Каш кайтарлар неме жок,", "en": "There was no one at all to guard the frontier,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Каш кайтарлар is a provisional reading; каш may refer to an edge or frontier.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf031:l023", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 31, "folio": 414, "line_in_page": 23, "raw": "Бейлеп көр, Бээжин ушу журт,", "text": "Бейлеп көр, Бээжин ушу журт,", "en": "Look closely: this people is Beijing,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The opening imperative is provisionally read Бейлеп көр.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf031:l024", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 31, "folio": 414, "line_in_page": 24, "raw": "Колойдун кор кара күчү,", "text": "Колойдун кор кара күчү,", "en": "Koloy’s grim, dark might,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The name Колой and the intensifying phrase кор кара are best-effort readings.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf031:l025", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 31, "folio": 414, "line_in_page": 25, "raw": "Бу кара жоону Дыйшанын,", "text": "Бу кара жоону Дыйшанын,", "en": "This black host belongs to Dyisha,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The final proper name and possessive ending are provisionally read Дыйшанын.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf031:l026", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 31, "folio": 414, "line_in_page": 26, "raw": "Кара курттай калкы бар,", "text": "Кара курттай калкы бар,", "en": "He has a people swarming like black worms,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf031:l027", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 31, "folio": 414, "line_in_page": 27, "raw": "Кырк уруу журт жалпы бар,", "text": "Кырк уруу журт жалпы бар,", "en": "All the people of forty tribes are there,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf031:l028", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 31, "folio": 414, "line_in_page": 28, "raw": "Жалпы журттун агасы,", "text": "Жалпы журттун агасы,", "en": "The elder of all the people,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf031:l029", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 31, "folio": 414, "line_in_page": 29, "raw": "Найзагердин ыктуусу,", "text": "Найзагердин ыктуусу,", "en": "The ablest of the spearmen,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The last word is provisionally read ыктуусу.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf031:l030", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 31, "folio": 414, "line_in_page": 30, "raw": "Топ мингендин тазасы,", "text": "Топ мингендин тазасы,", "en": "The finest of those who mount the troop,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Топ мингендин is visually likely, though the expression may carry a specialized martial sense.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf031:l031", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 31, "folio": 414, "line_in_page": 31, "raw": "Бул Бээжиндин паашасы,", "text": "Бул Бээжиндин паашасы,", "en": "This is the pasha of Beijing,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
